m/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27#:~:text=He%20swipes%20at%20the,my%20precious%20reference%20texts.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Ascension of Reza\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 27 Feb 2019."}},{"id":"ascension-reza-2019-02-27-e6","era":null,"summary":"Missing his identity rune, Reza throws a vial of cleansing oil at the arresters and flees, fearing arrest under his own new law.","participants":["reza","azorius-senate"],"location":"thinktank","importance":"major","page":"stories/ascension-reza-2019-02-27","order":612,"story_date":"2019-02-27","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":100,"quote":"I retrieve it from the satchel, then throw it down at the arrester's feet.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27#:~:text=I%20retrieve%20it%20from,at%20the%20arrester%27s%20feet.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Ascension of Reza","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-02-27","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27#:~:text=I%20retrieve%20it%20from,at%20the%20arrester%27s%20feet.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Ascension of Reza\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 27 Feb 2019."}},{"id":"ascension-reza-2019-02-27-e7","era":null,"summary":"Hendrik and Janin rescue Reza in a thopter vehicle assembled from stolen Azorius parts, and Reza realizes Hendrik is the thopter shooter.","participants":["hendrik-azmerak","janin","reza"],"location":"thinktank","importance":"minor","page":"stories/ascension-reza-2019-02-27","order":612,"story_date":"2019-02-27","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":103,"quote":"You're the 'mad genius' who's been shooting down thopters!